        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app covers all of Switzerland. Tap ‘Add’ to choose the operators you care about, then switch between them with a tap. Line search is limited to your operators."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'app de la montre affiche les départs de l'arrêt le plus proche, et vous laisse choisir parmi les autres arrêts proches." : {
      "localizations" : {
